I'm not hungry anymore. I have to rest for a while. Is that okay with you, Stan?

00:57:09.780 --> 00:57:17.630
You're okay with me, Laika. But what happens when you wake up and you're hungry again?

00:57:18.620 --> 00:57:20.140
Then I would need to eat again.

00:57:20.970 --> 00:57:23.470
We will try to find you a planet suitable to your needs.

00:57:24.450 --> 00:57:25.310
That would be nice.

00:57:34.730 --> 00:57:35.390
Sweet dreams.

00:57:51.860 --> 00:57:53.680
Not as much as me, maggot brain.

00:57:54.320 --> 00:57:57.540
I promised there were going to be no more insults.

00:57:58.350 --> 00:57:58.870
I lied.

00:58:14.460 --> 00:58:29.550
You should dress, well, to make something?

00:58:30.220 --> 00:58:30.700
Out of what?

00:58:31.540 --> 00:58:32.640
Cluster lizard, of course.

00:58:37.160 --> 00:58:37.620
Ooh.

00:59:00.120 --> 00:59:24.450
All new episode.

00:59:26.110 --> 00:59:26.370
The M.

00:59:27.840 --> 00:59:28.120
Sci-Fi.

01:00:04.892 --> 01:00:06.892
aluminum
